# Azure Beastbinder: "This creature can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or greater" (CR 509.1b). Bot2's Grizzly Bears
# (power 2) may not block it, its Llanowar Elves (power 1) may and dies to the Beastbinder's 1 damage. The attack trigger is aimed at
# Bot2's Mox Emerald so no creature's size changes.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Azure Beastbinder
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Grizzly Bears
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Azure Beastbinder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Azure Beastbinder > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears > Bot1.Battlefield.Azure Beastbinder)
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves > Bot1.Battlefield.Azure Beastbinder)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Life = 20
